OL,3,AChancellor says UK economy 'turning a
OL,4,Acorner' despite debt concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chancellor has given an upbeat view
OL,7,Fof the state of the UK economy ahead of
OL,8,Fnext month's Budget, building on a
OL,9,Frecent uptick in consumer and business
OL,10,Fconfidence.
OL,12,FIn a speech on Monday in Coventry, John
OL,13,FHealey spoke of a "new story" of the
OL,14,Feconomy not just turning a corner but
OL,15,Fbeing resilient, optimistic and "ready
OL,16,Fto seize the opportunities of new
OL,17,Ftechnologies and ideas".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,112,105,200,300,0,100
