OL,3,AChancellor says UK economy 'turning a
OL,4,Acorner' despite debt concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut nearby, Jaguar Land Rover announced
OL,7,Fit would cut 4,000 jobs to save costs
OL,8,Ffollowing competition from China for
OL,9,Fcheap cars, US tariffs on UK vehicles
OL,10,Fand the after effects of a cyber
OL,11,Fattack.
OL,13,FHealey is also facing concerns about
OL,14,Fgovernment borrowing costs and the
OL,15,Finflationary impact of the Iran war.
